Feature: Data Integration and Validation for Purgo Playground

  Background:
    Given the Unity Catalog Schema is "purgo_playground"
    And the table "sample_sales_data" exists with columns "country_cd", "product_id", "qty_sold", "sales_date"
    And the table "sample_users_data" exists with columns "country_cd", "product_id", "qty_sold", "sales_date", "valid"

  Scenario: Validate and Integrate Data from Sample Users Data
    Given the "valid" column in "sample_users_data" is used to filter records
    When the "valid" column value is 1
    Then the record should be considered for integration

  Scenario Outline: Successful Data Integration
    Given a record in "sample_users_data" with country_cd "<country_cd>", product_id "<product_id>", qty_sold "<qty_sold>", sales_date "<sales_date>", valid "<valid>"
    When the "valid" column value is 1
    Then the record should be integrated with "sample_sales_data"
    And the integrated data should match the format:
      | country_cd | product_id | qty_sold | sales_date  |
    Examples:
      | country_cd | product_id | qty_sold | sales_date  | valid |
      | US         | P1001      | 50       | 2024-01-15  | 1     |
      | US         | P1002      | 30       | 2024-01-16  | 1     |
      | CA         | P1001      | 40       | 2024-01-15  | 1     |
      | CA         | P1003      | 25       | 2024-01-17  | 1     |

  Scenario: Error Handling for Invalid Records
    Given a record in "sample_users_data" with valid column value 0
    When the record is processed
    Then an error message "Record is invalid and cannot be integrated" should be logged

  Scenario: Data Transformation and Calculation
    Given a record in "sample_users_data" with qty_sold "<qty_sold>"
    When the data is integrated
    Then the qty_sold should be summed for each product_id and country_cd
    And the result should be stored in "sample_sales_data"

  Scenario Outline: Error Scenario for Missing Data
    Given a record in "sample_users_data" with missing "<column>"
    When the record is processed
    Then an error message "Missing data in <column>" should be logged
    Examples:
      | column      |
      | country_cd  |
      | product_id  |
      | qty_sold    |
      | sales_date  |

  Scenario: Constraints and Limitations
    Given the data processing constraints
    When the data is processed
    Then the storage should not exceed the allocated space
    And processing time should be within acceptable limits